  "description": {
    "en": "Toroline COLE Blend, developed with Cole Shoults, combines firm O-TORO TOUR 1.23 Mint mains with medium-flex O-TORO 1.23 Neon Green crosses. The O-TORO TOUR mains create a stable, durable and highly controlled platform, while the more responsive O-TORO crosses contribute explosive snapback, heavy spin, pocketing and additional comfort. The result is a precision-oriented dual-poly hybrid with a clean launch, penetrating ball flight and enough spin response to support aggressive full swings.",

    "zh": "Toroline COLE Blend 与 Cole Shoults 共同开发，采用偏硬的 O-TORO TOUR 1.23 Mint 作为主线，并搭配中等 Flex 的 O-TORO 1.23 Neon Green 作为横线。O-TORO TOUR 主线建立高控制、高稳定和耐久的线床基础，而 O-TORO 横线则补充更强 Snapback、旋转、Pocketing 和一定舒适性。整体形成一套兼顾精准与旋转的双聚酯 Hybrid，特点是干净的 Launch、具穿透力的球路，以及高速完整挥拍时非常强的信心和稳定性。"
  },

